cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the conference paper below."
title: "Few-Shot Cross-Load Bearing Fault Diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Self-supervised representation learning for rolling-bearing fault diagnosis
  under operating-condition shift and a small labelled budget: one 1D
  convolutional autoencoder per sensor channel, pretrained with a hybrid masked
  reconstruction and contrastive objective, frozen and fused for a few-shot
  classification head.
authors:
